    <briefdescription>
<para>Groups all <ref refid="structthemis_1_1_conflict_record" kindref="compound">ConflictRecord</ref> artifacts produced by a single failed commit. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>A single transaction that writes N keys and then fails will produce N individual <ref refid="structthemis_1_1_conflict_record" kindref="compound">ConflictRecord</ref> entries (one per key) plus one <ref refid="structthemis_1_1_conflict_set" kindref="compound">ConflictSet</ref> that references all of them. Callers receive the conflict_set_id in the returned Status so they can look up the full picture with a single key.</para>
<para>Storage key: <computeroutput>conflictset:&lt;<ref refid="structthemis_1_1_conflict_set_1aeb9a9f1ba7d1d172203d8575102b7e63" kindref="member">conflict_set_id</ref>&gt;</computeroutput> </para>
    </detaileddescription>
